# What the deploy does not need to upload.
#
# The CLI refused a deploy at 47,413 files against a 15,000 limit. Almost all of
# it is `corpus/` — 46,956 scanned pages, extracted text and taxonomy JSON, which
# is the input to the ingestion scripts and is never read by the running app. Its
# contents reach production as rows in Postgres, not as files beside the server.
#
# Git already ignores these; `.vercelignore` is separate and the CLI does not
# read `.gitignore`, so an untracked directory is still uploaded without this.

# The corpus. Ingested offline, served from the database.
corpus/
uploads/

# Rebuilt on Vercel from package-lock.json and the source.
node_modules/
.next/

# Local only.
.git/
*.log
